---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="Motion" description="Duraciones y easings --ds-motion-*.">
  <h1>Motion</h1>
  <p>
    Duraciones y curvas viven en la capa reference
    (<code>tokens/reference.json</code> → <code>--ds-motion-*</code>).
  </p>

  <table class="ds-token-table">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Token</th>
        <th>Uso</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td><code>--ds-motion-duration-fast</code></td>
        <td>microinteracciones</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><code>--ds-motion-duration-normal</code></td>
        <td>transiciones de UI</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><code>--ds-motion-duration-slow</code></td>
        <td>entradas enfatizadas</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><code>--ds-motion-easing-standard</code></td>
        <td>movimiento estándar</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><code>--ds-motion-easing-emphasized</code></td>
        <td>énfasis</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2>Demo</h2>
  <p>Hover (respeta <code>prefers-reduced-motion: reduce</code>):</p>
  <div class="ds-foundation-row">
    <div class="ds-motion-demo" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <code
      >transition: … var(--ds-motion-duration-normal) var(--ds-motion-easing-standard)</code
    >
  </div>
</Base>
